 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? It' a good sign. Learned language before sleep makes it stick faster. Did you understand what people were saying? It could be a mix. Your own voice sounds different in your head, so it' hard to tell. Try repeating what people said back to them. Keep practicing, but vary it. Repeat the same thing with the other hand, or learn a short story. Mixing it up helps more than repeating the same thing. That's fantastic. Now try recall. Can you remember anything from the dream?",
